<title>USA: Cablevision Systems Corp Q3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Cablevision Systems Corp Q3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $4.31     loss	 $1.85</p>
<p> Net loss		 106,931     loss	44,033</p>
<p> Revs		     331,122		  278,158</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $13.12     loss	$10.29</p>
<p> Net loss		 325,580     loss     244,390</p>
<p> Revs		     955,618		  787,293</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine month loss reflects write-off of certain deferred financing costs of $34.3 million.</p>
<p>1995 nine month loss includes a gain of $36.2 million from sales of affiliate interests.</p>
<p>Cablevision acquired Bablevision of Boston, SportsChannel New York and News 12 Long Island in the third and fourth quarters of 1995. The company acquired U.S. Cable during the third quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Q3 cash flow $116.1 million vs $102.5 million.</p>
<p>Nine month cash flow $336.6 million vs $301.3 million.</p>
</text>
